{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"chatcmpl-tool-b2a14b3ed64c0418","type":"tool_result","content":"1\t---\n2\tepic_id: RHAISTRAT-9019-E003\n3\ttitle: Author five curated notebook tutorials\n4\tparent_strat: RHAISTRAT-9019\n5\tcomponent: Notebooks\n6\tteam: Workbenches\n7\ttype: Implementation\n8\tpriority: P0\n9\tdependencies:\n10\t- RHAISTRAT-9019-E001\n11\tai_signals:\n12\t  change_specificity: 1\n13\t  pattern_precedent: 0\n14\t  adapter_pattern: 0\n15\t  existing_foundation: 1\n16\t  open_questions: 1\n17\t  external_dependency: 1\n18\t  human_process_gates: 0\n19\t  repo_access: 1\n20\t  architecture_claims: 0\n21\timplementation_type: null\n22\tinvestigation_signals: null\n23\tai_implementability: High\n24\tai_implementability_score: 5\n25\tjira_key: null\n26\tbranch: null\n27\tgated_by: null\n28\tgate_failure_impact: null\n29\t---\n30\t# Author five curated notebook tutorials\n31\t\n32\t## Description\n33\t\n34\tThis epic authors five of the six curated getting-started tutorials as\n35\tnotebooks, covering the core notebook-driven journeys: first workbench, data\n36\tprep, first training run, first deployment, and first RAG app. This is\n37\tsubstantive content authoring — maintained, tested tutorial material — distinct\n38\tfrom the Dashboard product code, with its own review cycle.\n39\t\n40\t## Scope\n41\t\n42\t- Author the following tutorials as notebooks:\n43\t  - First workbench (create a project, spawn a workbench, run a first cell)\n44\t  - Data prep (load and prepare a dataset in a workbench)\n45\t  - First training run (train a first model)\n46\t  - First deployment (serve a trained model)\n47\t  - First RAG app (build a first retrieval-augmented generation app)\n48\t- Package each tutorial in the defined tutorial packaging format with its\n49\t  metadata, pinned workbench images, and validation manifest\n50\t- Test each tutorial against the current platform release\n51\t- Keep tutorials self-contained and runnable from a clean project so they are\n52\t  suitable for one-click launch from the Dashboard tutorial gallery\n53\t\n54\t## Acceptance Criteria\n55\t\n56\t- Five notebook tutorials exist covering the first workbench, data prep, first\n57\t  training run, first deployment, and first RAG app journeys\n58\t- Each tutorial is packaged per the tutorial packaging format (metadata,\n59\t  pinned images, validation manifest)\n60\t- Each tutorial passes the checks declared in its validation manifest against\n61\t  the current platform release\n62\t- Each tutorial runs end-to-end in a clean user project\n63\t\n64\t## HLR Traceability\n65\t\n66\t- **HLR-2** (P0, shared): Six curated tutorials exist covering the core\n67\t  journeys, each tested against the current release. This epic covers the five\n68\t  notebook-driven journeys of HLR-2; the first-pipeline journey is covered by\n69\t  the pipeline tutorial work owned by the Pipelines team.\n70\t"}]},"parent_tool_use_id":"chatcmpl-tool-9244e46392ce2601","agent_id":"ac53652ab22c18a4f","session_id":"93b0d1e1-8c2e-4425-b7ff-b40e259bbfcd","uuid":"afad1b81-7c2c-4c1a-91bf-0b1c54ce85be","timestamp":"2026-10-22T01:39:25.135Z","tool_result_meta":[{"id":"chatcmpl-tool-b2a14b3ed64c0418","permission_decision":{"decision":"accept","source":"config","reason_type":"mode"}}],"subagent_type":"general-purpose","task_description":"Review RHAISTRAT-9019 decomposition"}
