50\t  package for a pipeline tutorial, demonstrating both launch paths\n51\t- Review the format specification with the consuming teams (Dashboard,\n52\t  Workbenches, Pipelines) so all consumers commit to one shared schema\n53\t\n54\t## Acceptance Criteria\n55\t\n56\t- The format specification defines metadata, image pinning, and the validation\n57\t  manifest such that a tutorial packaged per the format can be versioned and\n58\t  validated independently of a Dashboard release\n59\t- A notebook tutorial packaged per the format passes the checks declared in its\n60\t  validation manifest\n61\t- A pipeline tutorial packaged per the format passes the checks declared in its\n62\t  validation manifest\n63\t- The format specification is reviewed and accepted by the Dashboard,\n64\t  Workbenches, and Pipelines teams\n65\t\n66\t## HLR Traceability\n67\t\n68\t- **HLR-3** (P1): A tutorial packaging format (metadata, pinned images,\n69\t  validation manifest) is defined so tutorials are versioned and testable\n70\t  independently of Dashboard releases. This epic fully covers HLR-3.\n71\t  Epic priority is P0 by inheritance: this epic transitively enables the P0\n72\t  HLR-1 (gallery launch) and HLR-2 (curated tutorials) work.\n73\t"}]},"parent_tool_use_id":"chatcmpl-tool-a24ffe3bc7ddb63f","agent_id":"af103264e5f155e9c","session_id":"93b0d1e1-8c2e-4425-b7ff-b40e259bbfcd","uuid":"7ec966a0-8c4d-46e7-9226-8e97095361a7","timestamp":"2026-10-22T01:43:39.903Z","tool_result_meta":[{"id":"chatcmpl-tool-9a16fcb30f8b81e1","permission_decision":{"decision":"accept","source":"config","reason_type":"mode"}}],"subagent_type":"general-purpose","task_description":"Revise RHAISTRAT-9019 decomposition"}
