nifest)\n51\t- The gallery is scoped to curated platform tutorials; community/partner\n52\t  intake tooling and localization are out of scope for this release\n53\t\n54\t## Acceptance Criteria\n55\t\n56\t- A user can open the tutorial gallery from the Dashboard\n57\t- The gallery displays tutorial metadata read from packages in the defined\n58\t  tutorial packaging format\n59\t- Launching a notebook tutorial from the gallery creates a workbench in the\n60\t  user's project with the tutorial notebook available in it\n61\t- Launching a pipeline tutorial from the gallery imports the pipeline into the\n62\t  user's project\n63\t- Each of the six curated tutorials covering the core journeys (first\n64\t  workbench, data prep, first training run, first pipeline, first deployment,\n65\t  first RAG app) launches successfully end-to-end from the gallery\n66\t- The launch path follows existing Dashboard patterns for creating workbenches\n67\t  and importing pipelines (no new private component APIs; Kubernetes\n68\t  resources only)\n69\t\n70\t## HLR Traceability\n71\t\n72\t- **HLR-1** (P0): The Dashboard has a tutorial gallery from which a user can\n73\t  launch a tutorial into their project (opening a workbench with the notebook,\n74\t  or importing the pipeline). This epic fully covers HLR-1.\n75\t"}]},"parent_tool_use_id":"chatcmpl-tool-a24ffe3bc7ddb63f","agent_id":"af103264e5f155e9c","session_id":"93b0d1e1-8c2e-4425-b7ff-b40e259bbfcd","uuid":"088d2247-c992-4a2f-ae6e-cc96d9505e0f","timestamp":"2026-10-22T01:43:40.581Z","tool_result_meta":[{"id":"chatcmpl-tool-b7ba9193fc94619a","permission_decision":{"decision":"accept","source":"config","reason_type":"mode"}}],"subagent_type":"general-purpose","task_description":"Revise RHAISTRAT-9019 decomposition"}
