inimal worked example package for a pipeline tutorial — small exemplars that\n51\t  validate the format and demonstrate both launch paths. These are\n52\t  format-validation fixtures only, not full tutorials; the curated tutorial\n53\t  content itself is authored separately by the owning teams, so no tutorial\n54\t  authoring effort is duplicated here\n55\t- Review the format specification with the consuming teams (Dashboard,\n56\t  Workbenches, Pipelines) so all consumers commit to one shared schema\n57\t\n58\t## Acceptance Criteria\n59\t\n60\t- The format specification defines metadata, image pinning, and the validation\n61\t  manifest such that a tutorial packaged per the format can be versioned and\n62\t  validated independently of a Dashboard release\n63\t- A notebook tutorial packaged per the format passes the checks declared in its\n64\t  validation manifest\n65\t- A pipeline tutorial packaged per the format passes the checks declared in its\n66\t  validation manifest\n67\t- The format specification is reviewed and accepted by the Dashboard,\n68\t  Workbenches, and Pipelines teams\n69\t\n70\t## HLR Traceability\n71\t\n72\t- **HLR-3** (P1): A tutorial packaging format (metadata, pinned images,\n73\t  validation manifest) is defined so tutorials are versioned and testable\n74\t  independently of Dashboard releases. This epic fully covers HLR-3.\n75\t  Epic priority is P0 by inheritance: this epic transitively enables the P0\n76\t  HLR-1 (gallery launch) and HLR-2 (curated tutorials) work.\n77\t"}]},"parent_tool_use_id":"chatcmpl-tool-997a373b82a42ae5","agent_id":"a2bedf741f0327ef9","session_id":"93b0d1e1-8c2e-4425-b7ff-b40e259bbfcd","uuid":"dc375c32-070c-4513-a7f8-104fb9c8fb95","timestamp":"2026-10-22T01:46:57.383Z","tool_result_meta":[{"id":"chatcmpl-tool-921df424b7f16052","permission_decision":{"decision":"accept","source":"config","reason_type":"mode"}}],"subagent_type":"general-purpose","task_description":"Re-review RHAISTRAT-9019 decomposition"}
