{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"chatcmpl-tool-8878ac40450e6fb9","type":"tool_result","content":"1\t---\n2\tepic_id: RHAISTRAT-9019-E002\n3\ttitle: Tutorial gallery and one-click launch in the Dashboard\n4\tparent_strat: RHAISTRAT-9019\n5\tcomponent: Dashboard\n6\tteam: RHOAI Dashboard\n7\ttype: Implementation\n8\tpriority: P0\n9\tdependencies:\n10\t- RHAISTRAT-9019-E001\n11\t- RHAISTRAT-9019-E003\n12\t- RHAISTRAT-9019-E004\n13\tai_signals:\n14\t  change_specificity: 0\n15\t  pattern_precedent: 1\n16\t  adapter_pattern: 1\n17\t  existing_foundation: 1\n18\t  open_questions: 1\n19\t  external_dependency: 1\n20\t  human_process_gates: 0\n21\t  repo_access: 1\n22\t  architecture_claims: 1\n23\timplementation_type: null\n24\tinvestigation_signals: null\n25\tai_implementability: High\n26\tai_implementability_score: 7\n27\tjira_key: null\n28\tbranch: null\n29\tgated_by: null\n30\tgate_failure_impact: null\n31\t---\n32\t# Tutorial gallery and one-click launch in the Dashboard\n33\t\n34\t## Description\n35\t\n36\tThis epic delivers the tutorial gallery in the Dashboard: a surface where\n37\tusers browse curated tutorials and launch one into their own project with one\n38\tclick — opening a workbench with the tutorial notebook, or importing the\n39\ttutorial pipeline. This is the product-code work stream of the tutorial gallery\n40\tstrategy, owned by the Dashboard team.\n41\t\n42\tThis epic is verified against the curated tutorial set: its end-to-end launch\n43\tacceptance criteria exercise the six curated tutorials covering the core\n44\tjourneys, so the gallery work completes after the curated notebook tutorials\n45\tand the first-pipeline tutorial have been authored and packaged.\n46\t\n47\t## Scope\n48\t\n49\t- A tutorial gallery surface in the Dashboard that lists available tutorials\n50\t  and renders their packaged metadata (title, description, journey)\n51\t- One-click launch mechanics for notebook tutorials: create a workbench in the\n52\t  user's project with the tutorial notebook, using the pinned images declared\n53\t  by the tutorial package\n54\t- One-click launch mechanics for pipeline tutorials: import the pipeline into\n55\t  the project's Data Science Pipelines instance\n56\t- Reading tutorial packages in the defined tutorial packaging format\n57\t  (metadata, pinned images, validation manifest)\n58\t- The gallery is scoped to curated platform tutorials; community/partner\n59\t  intake tooling and localization are out of scope for this release\n60\t\n61\t## Acceptance Criteria\n62\t\n63\t- A user can open the tutorial gallery from the Dashboard\n64\t- The gallery displays tutorial metadata read from packages in the defined\n65\t  tutorial packaging format\n66\t- Launching a notebook tutorial from the gallery creates a workbench in the\n67\t  user's project with the tutorial notebook available in it\n68\t- Launching a pipeline tutorial from the gallery imports the pipeline into the\n69\t  user's project\n70\t- Each of the six curated tutorials covering the core journeys (first\n71\t  workbench, data prep, first training run, first pipeline, first deployment,\n72\t  first RAG app) launches successfully end-to-end from the gallery\n73\t- The launch path follows existing Dashboard patterns for creating workbenches\n74\t  and importing pipelines (no new private component APIs; Kubernetes\n75\t  resources only)\n76\t\n77\t## HLR Traceability\n78\t\n79\t- **HLR-1** (P0): The Dashboard has a tutorial gallery from which a user can\n80\t  launch a tutorial into their project (opening a workbench with the notebook,\n81\t  or importing the pipeline). This epic fully covers HLR-1.\n82\t"}]},"parent_tool_use_id":"chatcmpl-tool-997a373b82a42ae5","agent_id":"a2bedf741f0327ef9","session_id":"93b0d1e1-8c2e-4425-b7ff-b40e259bbfcd","uuid":"75eda294-93db-4346-9a15-a8d692060660","timestamp":"2026-10-22T01:46:58.284Z","tool_result_meta":[{"id":"chatcmpl-tool-8878ac40450e6fb9","permission_decision":{"decisi